{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Try It Free \u2013 Support If You\u2019d Like</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the core Foxel experience right now for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access version on Steam includes that same foundation, with new features coming in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchasing Early Access is totally optional \u2014 it simply supports development and helps me keep building the world of Foxel. If you\u2019d rather just try it first, DM or join the Discord</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sculpt it. Build it. Test it.</strong><br><i>Foxel</i> is a creative sandbox game where you sculpt custom cars out of voxels and put them to the test on real tracks. Inspired by the spirit of Pinewood Derby racing, <i>Foxel</i> blends creativity, physics, and experimentation into a fun, hands-on design experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing speed records or just building something weird that barely rolls, <i>Foxel</i> invites you to express yourself block by block.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voxel-Based Car Sculpting</strong> \u2013 Carve your vehicle out of a solid block using intuitive 2D and 3D editing tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Physics Simulation</strong> \u2013 Your design affects speed, handling, and stability \u2014 mass placement matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Tracks &amp; Challenges</strong> \u2013 Race your creations on tracks with ramps, loops, and jumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Edit Modes</strong> \u2013 Switch between side view and top-down sculpting to refine your shape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom</strong> \u2013 Build wild experiments or refined racers \u2014 the rules are yours to break</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867640?t=1768716585","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867640/357703b3ab70df628bcf37978e60427e8fcbe164/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768716585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867640/c37d98734dc717ab0fac88768d9881089436b2ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768716585","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867640/c37d98734dc717ab0fac88768d9881089436b2ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768716585","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Try It Free \u2013 Support If You\u2019d Like</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the core Foxel experience right now for free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Early Access version on Steam includes that same foundation, with new features coming in future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchasing Early Access is totally optional \u2014 it simply supports development and helps me keep building the world of Foxel. If you\u2019d rather just try it first, DM or join the Discord</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sculpt it. Build it. Test it.</strong><br><i>Foxel</i> is a creative sandbox game where you sculpt custom cars out of voxels and put them to the test on real tracks. Inspired by the spirit of Pinewood Derby racing, <i>Foxel</i> blends creativity, physics, and experimentation into a fun, hands-on design experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing speed records or just building something weird that barely rolls, <i>Foxel</i> invites you to express yourself block by block.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voxel-Based Car Sculpting</strong> \u2013 Carve your vehicle out of a solid block using intuitive 2D and 3D editing tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Physics Simulation</strong> \u2013 Your design affects speed, handling, and stability \u2014 mass placement matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Tracks &amp; Challenges</strong> \u2013 Race your creations on tracks with ramps, loops, and jumps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Edit Modes</strong> \u2013 Switch between side view and top-down sculpting to refine your shape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom</strong> \u2013 Build wild experiments or refined racers \u2014 the rules are yours to break</p></li></ul>","developers":["Eddy Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Animation & Modeling","id":"51"},{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Education","id":"54"},{"description":"Game Development","id":"60"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867640/df54e64a9357b235dde70078701475474d940792/header.jpg?t=1768716585","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867640/743751421/5c8499c2833d6f2a2ec41f7d6f5a6999264eb8f4/1768714798/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768716584","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867640/743751421/5c8499c2833d6f2a2ec41f7d6f5a6999264eb8f4/1768714798/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768716584","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867640/743751421/5c8499c2833d6f2a2ec41f7d6f5a6999264eb8f4/1768714798/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768716584","id":257267212,"name":"Steam Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257267212/cf7a24e72717b